arguments.cmd:
cat > /app/output/index.html <<'HTML'
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <meta name="description" content="Global Aid Alliance delivers disaster relief, emergency assistance, and community resilience support worldwide." />
  <title>Global Aid Alliance — Together We Respond</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --primary-red: #C41E3A;
      --navy: #1B3A5C;
      --white: #FFFFFF;
      --warm-gray-50: #faf8f6;
      --warm-gray-100: #f2efeb;
      --warm-gray-200: #e4ded8;
      --warm-gray-600: #6f645d;
      --warm-gray-800: #3a332f;
      --text: #2e2a27;
      --shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(27, 58, 92, 0.12);
      --radius: 14px;
      --radius-sm: 10px;
      --container: 1120px;
      --transition: 220ms ease;
    }

    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: Inter, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;
      color: var(--text);
      background: var(--white);
      line-height: 1.55;
    }

    h1, h2, h3 {
      font-family: "Segoe UI", Inter, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;
      color: var(--navy);
      line-height: 1.2;
      margin: 0 0 0.6rem;
    }

    p { margin: 0 0 1rem; }
    a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }

    .container {
      width: min(100% - 2rem, var(--container));
      margin-inline: auto;
    }

    .sr-only {
      position: absolute;
      width: 1px;
      height: 1px;
      padding: 0;
      margin: -1px;
      overflow: hidden;
      clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0);
      white-space: nowrap;
      border: 0;
    }

    .btn {
      border: 0;
      border-radius: 999px;
      padding: 0.78rem 1.25rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: transform var(--transition), background var(--transition), color var(--transition), box-shadow var(--transition);
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 0.4rem;
    }

    .btn:focus-visible, .nav-link:focus-visible, .utility-link:focus-visible {
      outline: 3px solid rgba(196, 30, 58, 0.3);
      outline-offset: 2px;
    }

    .btn-primary {
      background: var(--primary-red);
      color: var(--white);
      box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(196, 30, 58, 0.28);
    }

    .btn-primary:hover { transform: translateY(-1px); }

    .btn-secondary {
      background: var(--white);
      border: 2px solid var(--navy);
      color: var(--navy);
    }

    .btn-secondary:hover {
      background: var(--navy);
      color: var(--white);
    }

    header {
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 40;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.97);
      backdrop-filter: blur(4px);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--warm-gray-200);
    }

    .utility-bar {
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--warm-gray-100);
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      color: var(--warm-gray-600);
    }

    .utility-inner {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: flex-end;
      gap: 1rem;
      padding: 0.5rem 0;
    }

    .header-main {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 1rem;
      padding: 0.82rem 0;
    }

    .brand {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.65rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: var(--navy);
    }

    .brand-mark {
      width: 38px;
      height: 38px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary-red), #a81730);
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      color: var(--white);
      font-weight: 800;
    }

    .nav-wrap {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 1rem;
    }

    .main-nav {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.85rem;
    }

    .nav-link {
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--warm-gray-800);
      padding: 0.45rem 0.55rem;
      border-radius: 6px;
    }

    .nav-link:hover { background: var(--warm-gray-100); }

    .hamburger {
      display: none;
      border: 1px solid var(--warm-gray-200);
      background: var(--white);
      border-radius: 10px;
      padding: 0.45rem;
      width: 42px;
      height: 42px;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .hamburger span {
      display: block;
      width: 20px;
      height: 2px;
      background: var(--navy);
      margin: 4px auto;
      transition: transform var(--transition), opacity var(--transition);
    }

    .mobile-drawer {
      display: none;
      background: var(--white);
      border-top: 1px solid var(--warm-gray-200);
      transform-origin: top;
      animation: slideDown var(--transition);
    }

    .mobile-drawer.open { display: block; }

    .mobile-drawer a {
      display: block;
      padding: 0.92rem 1rem;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--warm-gray-100);
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .hero {
      background: linear-gradient(rgba(27,58,92,0.64), rgba(27,58,92,0.64)),
        url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1476231790875-016a80c274f5?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1700&q=80') center/cover no-repeat;
      color: var(--white);
      padding: clamp(4rem, 8vw, 7rem) 0;
    }

    .hero h1 {
      color: var(--white);
      font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.35rem);
      max-width: 12ch;
    }

    .hero p {
      max-width: 62ch;
      font-size: clamp(1rem, 2vw, 1.15rem);
      opacity: 0.95;
    }

    .hero-actions {
      margin-top: 1.5rem;
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 0.8rem;
    }

    section { padding: clamp(3rem, 8vw, 5.3rem) 0; }

    .section-title {
      font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 3vw, 2.35rem);
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    .mission {
      background: var(--warm-gray-50);
    }

    .impact-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 1rem;
      margin-top: 1.4rem;
    }

    .stat-card {
      background: var(--white);
      border: 1px solid var(--warm-gray-200);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      padding: 1.2rem;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
      text-align: center;
    }

    .stat-number {
      color: var(--primary-red);
      font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 2.6rem);
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    }

    .stat-label { color: var(--warm-gray-800); font-weight: 600; }

    .programs-wrap { margin-top: 1.2rem; }

    .accordion-item {
      border: 1px solid var(--warm-gray-200);
      border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
      margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
      overflow: hidden;
      background: var(--white);
    }

    .accordion-trigger {
      width: 100%;
      text-align: left;
      border: 0;
      background: var(--white);
      padding: 1rem 1.1rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--navy);
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .accordion-content {
      max-height: 0;
      overflow: hidden;
      transition: max-height 280ms ease;
      border-top: 1px solid transparent;
    }

    .accordion-content-inner { padding: 0 1.1rem 1rem; }
    .accordion-item.open .accordion-content { border-top-color: var(--warm-gray-200); }

    .get-involved {
      background: var(--warm-gray-50);
    }

    .cards-3 {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 1rem;
      margin-top: 1.2rem;
    }

    .card {
      border: 1px solid var(--warm-gray-200);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      background: var(--white);
      overflow: hidden;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
    }

    .card img {
      width: 100%;
      aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;
      object-fit: cover;
    }

    .card-body { padding: 1rem; }

    .news-track-wrap { position: relative; overflow: hidden; }

    .news-track {
      display: flex;
      transition: transform 300ms ease;
    }

    .news-card {
      min-width: 100%;
      border: 1px solid var(--warm-gray-200);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      background: var(--white);
      padding: 1.2rem;
    }

    .news-controls {
      margin-top: 1rem;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: flex-end;
      gap: 0.5rem;
    }

    .icon-btn {
      width: 40px;
      height: 40px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      border: 1px solid var(--warm-gray-200);
      background: var(--white);
      color: var(--navy);
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .donate-cta {
      background: linear-gradient(145deg, #fff, #fff5f7);
    }

    .donation-table {
      width: 100%;
      border-collapse: collapse;
      margin-top: 1rem;
      background: var(--white);
      border: 1px solid var(--warm-gray-200);
      border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .donation-table th, .donation-table td {
      padding: 0.85rem;
      text-align: left;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--warm-gray-100);
    }

    .donation-table tr:last-child td { border-bottom: 0; }

    footer {
      background: #12253b;
      color: #dce6f1;
      padding: 2.8rem 0 1.2rem;
    }

    .footer-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 1rem;
    }

    .footer-title {
      color: var(--white);
      font-size: 1rem;
      margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
    }

    .footer-link {
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 0.45rem;
      color: #dce6f1;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
    }

    .footer-bottom {
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.18);
      margin-top: 1rem;
      padding-top: 1rem;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 1rem;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .modal-overlay {
      position: fixed;
      inset: 0;
      background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.52);
      display: none;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      z-index: 70;
      padding: 1rem;
    }

    .modal-overlay.open { display: flex; }

    .modal {
      width: min(100%, 560px);
      background: var(--white);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .modal-header {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 1rem 1rem 0.5rem;
    }

    .close-btn {
      border: 0;
      background: transparent;
      font-size: 1.5rem;
      cursor: pointer;
      line-height: 1;
    }

    .modal-content { padding: 0 1rem 1rem; }

    .amount-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 0.55rem;
      margin: 1rem 0;
    }

    .amount-option {
      border: 1px solid var(--warm-gray-200);
      background: var(--white);
      padding: 0.7rem;
      border-radius: 10px;
      font-weight: 700;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .amount-option.selected {
      background: #fff2f5;
      border-color: var(--primary-red);
      color: var(--primary-red);
    }

    .custom-input {
      width: 100%;
      border: 1px solid var(--warm-gray-200);
      border-radius: 10px;
      padding: 0.72rem;
      margin-bottom: 0.9rem;
    }

    @media (max-width: 960px) {
      .main-nav { display: none; }
      .hamburger { display: inline-block; }
      .header-main .btn-primary { display: none; }
      .impact-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); }
      .cards-3 { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .footer-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); }
    }

    @media (max-width: 640px) {
      .utility-inner { justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap; }
      .impact-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .footer-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .amount-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); }
      .hero-actions .btn { width: 100%; }
    }

    @keyframes slideDown {
      from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(-6px); }
      to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div class="utility-bar">
      <div class="container utility-inner">
        <a href="#" class="utility-link">Sign In</a>
        <a href="#" class="utility-link">Contact Us</a>
        <a href="#" class="utility-link">Español</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="container header-main">
      <a href="#top" class="brand" id="top" aria-label="Global Aid Alliance home">
        <span class="brand-mark" aria-hidden="true">GA</span>
        <span>Global Aid Alliance</span>
      </a>

      <div class="nav-wrap">
        <nav class="main-nav" aria-label="Main navigation">
          <a class="nav-link" href="#about">About Us</a>
          <a class="nav-link" href="#disaster-relief">Disaster Relief</a>
          <a class="nav-link" href="#programs">Programs &amp; Services</a>
          <a class="nav-link" href="#volunteer">Volunteer</a>
          <a class="nav-link" href="#chapter">Find Local Chapter</a>
        </nav>
        <button class="btn btn-primary" data-open-donate>Donate</button>
        <button class="hamburger" id="hamburger" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="mobile-drawer" aria-label="Open navigation menu">
          <span></span><span></span><span></span>
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="mobile-drawer" id="mobile-drawer" aria-label="Mobile navigation drawer">
      <a href="#about">About Us</a>
      <a href="#disaster-relief">Disaster Relief</a>
      <a href="#programs">Programs &amp; Services</a>
      <a href="#volunteer">Volunteer</a>
      <a href="#chapter">Find Local Chapter</a>
      <a href="#" data-open-donate>Donate</a>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
      <div class="container">
        <h1 id="hero-title">When Disaster Strikes, We're There</h1>
        <p>From hurricanes and wildfires to global health emergencies, Global Aid Alliance delivers immediate relief and long-term recovery support to communities in crisis.</p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <button class="btn btn-primary" data-open-donate>Donate Now</button>
          <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="#volunteer">Become a Volunteer</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="mission" id="about" aria-labelledby="mission-title">
      <div class="container">
        <h2 class="section-title" id="mission-title">Our Mission</h2>
        <p><strong>Global Aid Alliance prevents and alleviates human suffering in the face of emergencies by mobilizing the power of volunteers and the generosity of donors.</strong></p>
        <p>We are guided by the fundamental principles of humanity, impartiality, and neutrality. Every day, our teams work across borders and boundaries to ensure that help reaches those who need it most — regardless of race, religion, nationality, or political affiliation. From the first hours of a disaster to the years of recovery that follow, we stand with affected communities every step of the way.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="impact-stats" aria-labelledby="impact-title">
      <div class="container">
        <h2 class="section-title" id="impact-title">Our Impact at a Glance</h2>
        <p>These figures represent real lives changed — families sheltered after storms, blood delivered to hospitals, and communities rebuilt stronger than before.</p>
        <div class="impact-grid">
          <article class="stat-card">
            <div class="stat-number" data-counter="12000000" data-format="million">0</div>
            <div class="stat-label">People Assisted Annually</div>
          </article>
          <article class="stat-card" id="volunteer">
            <div class="stat-number" data-counter="50000" data-format="comma">0</div>
            <div class="stat-label">Volunteers Active</div>
          </article>
          <article class="stat-card" id="chapter">
            <div class="stat-number" data-counter="190" data-format="plain">0</div>
            <div class="stat-label">Countries Served</div>
          </article>
          <article class="stat-card">
            <div class="stat-number" data-counter="850000000" data-format="currency-million">0</div>
            <div class="stat-label">Raised Last Fiscal Year</div>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="programs" aria-labelledby="programs-title">
      <div class="container">
        <h2 class="section-title" id="programs-title">Programs &amp; Services</h2>
        <p>From immediate emergency response to long-term resilience, our programs are designed to meet urgent needs and build safer communities.</p>
        <div class="programs-wrap">
          <article class="accordion-item" id="disaster-relief">
            <button class="accordion-trigger" aria-expanded="false">Disaster Relief <span aria-hidden="true">+</span></button>
            <div class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-content-inner">
                Rapid deployment of emergency shelter, food, water, and medical supplies to communities affected by natural disasters and conflict. Our response teams are on the ground within 24 hours.
              </div>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article class="accordion-item">
            <button class="accordion-trigger" aria-expanded="false">Blood Donation <span aria-hidden="true">+</span></button>
            <div class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-content-inner">
                Operating one of the largest blood collection networks, we supply approximately 40% of the nation's blood and blood products to hospitals and medical facilities.
              </div>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article class="accordion-item">
            <button class="accordion-trigger" aria-expanded="false">Emergency Preparedness <span aria-hidden="true">+</span></button>
            <div class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-content-inner">
                Training individuals, families, and organizations to prepare for and respond to emergencies through workshops, certification courses, and community drills.
              </div>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article class="accordion-item">
            <button class="accordion-trigger" aria-expanded="false">International Humanitarian Aid <span aria-hidden="true">+</span></button>
            <div class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-content-inner">
                Partnering with a global network of humanitarian organizations to deliver relief and recovery programs in conflict zones and disaster-affected regions worldwide.
              </div>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article class="accordion-item">
            <button class="accordion-trigger" aria-expanded="false">Community Health <span aria-hidden="true">+</span></button>
            <div class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-content-inner">
                Providing health and safety education, disease prevention programs, and support services to underserved communities, including mental health resources for disaster survivors.
              </div>
            </div>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="get-involved" aria-labelledby="involved-title">
      <div class="container">
        <h2 class="section-title" id="involved-title">Get Involved</h2>
        <div class="cards-3">
          <article class="card">
            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1469571486292-b53601020f90?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80" alt="Diverse volunteers sorting aid supplies in a community relief center" loading="lazy" />
            <div class="card-body">
              <h3>Volunteer With Us</h3>
              <p>Join over 50,000 volunteers who give their time and skills to help people in need. Whether you can commit a few hours a month or deploy to a disaster zone, there's a role for you.</p>
              <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="#">Find Volunteer Opportunities</a>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article class="card">
            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1593113598332-cd288d649433?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80" alt="Neighborhood fundraiser event with community members supporting relief efforts" loading="lazy" />
            <div class="card-body">
              <h3>Start a Fundraiser</h3>
              <p>Rally your community, workplace, or school to raise funds for disaster relief. We provide toolkits and support to help you make the biggest impact.</p>
              <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="#">Start Your Fundraiser</a>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article class="card">
            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1615461066841-6116e61058f4?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80" alt="Healthcare worker preparing blood donation equipment at a drive location" loading="lazy" />
            <div class="card-body">
              <h3>Give Blood</h3>
              <p>Every two seconds, someone in the country needs blood. Schedule an appointment at a blood drive near you and help save lives.</p>
              <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="#">Find a Blood Drive</a>
            </div>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="news" aria-labelledby="news-title">
      <div class="container">
        <h2 class="section-title" id="news-title">Latest News</h2>
        <div class="news-track-wrap">
          <div class="news-track" id="news-track">
            <article class="news-card">
              <h3>Hurricane Response Update</h3>
              <p>Global Aid Alliance teams are providing shelter and supplies to over 15,000 families displaced by Hurricane Marlena along the Gulf Coast. Relief operations are ongoing across 12 counties.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="news-card">
              <h3>Wildfire Relief Efforts</h3>
              <p>Emergency shelters have been opened in three western states as crews battle record-breaking wildfires. Volunteers are distributing meals, water, and comfort kits to evacuees.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="news-card">
              <h3>Blood Drive Campaign</h3>
              <p>Our summer blood drive campaign has collected over 120,000 units so far, but hospitals still face critical shortages. New donation sites have been added nationwide.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="news-card">
              <h3>Volunteer Spotlight</h3>
              <p>Meet Daniela Torres, a disaster response volunteer who has deployed to seven emergencies in three years. Her story of service inspires communities across the country.</p>
            </article>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="news-controls">
          <button class="icon-btn" id="news-prev" aria-label="View previous news story">‹</button>
          <button class="icon-btn" id="news-next" aria-label="View next news story">›</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="donate-cta" aria-labelledby="donate-title">
      <div class="container">
        <h2 class="section-title" id="donate-title">Your Gift Makes a Difference</h2>
        <p>A donation of any size helps us respond to disasters, train volunteers, and support communities in crisis. <strong>91 cents of every dollar goes directly to humanitarian services.</strong></p>
        <table class="donation-table" aria-label="Donation impact table">
          <thead>
            <tr><th>Amount</th><th>Impact</th></tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr><td>$25</td><td>Provides 5 emergency blankets for displaced families</td></tr>
            <tr><td>$50</td><td>Supplies a family with food and water for one week</td></tr>
            <tr><td>$100</td><td>Funds emergency shelter materials for a household</td></tr>
            <tr><td>$250</td><td>Equips a volunteer with disaster response training</td></tr>
            <tr><td>Custom</td><td>Every dollar counts toward saving lives</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
        <p style="margin-top:1rem;"><button class="btn btn-primary" data-open-donate>Donate Now</button></p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

